    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061218.0087\n\nTHE HAGUE, Dec 18 , 2006, 2006\n\nDutch temp agency company Vedior to take over Norwegian Corridor\n\n\n\n\nThe Dutch temporary employment company Vedior announced Monday that it will take over Norwegian recruitment specialist Corridor for an undisclosed sum.\n\nCorridor specializes in the recruitment and supply of temporary and permanent staff within accounting and finance, sales and marketing, IT and administrative sectors and reported 2005 sales of 6.8 million euros (8.9 million dollars).\n\nVedior said it will take a majority stake in the company while Corridors existing management will keep a minority interest and will continue to develop the company.",
